e_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1004a6471cfbd7c3ebfe9ce3bd0f2de4ff9055a7", "message": "Create HR system\n\nHuman Resources System, with options for registration, consultation (general, by id and by sector) and removal of employees.\r\n\r\nSistema de Recursos Humanos, com op\u00e7\u00f5es de cadastro, consulta (geral, por id e por setor) e remo\u00e7\u00e3o de funcion\u00e1rios.", "created_at": "2022-10-17T15:51:13Z", "repo": "Python", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1a4089c2369342ea208e891a0f41199798648242", "message": "Update cleaning service\n\nCleaning service system, with if/elif/else structures, repeat loops, and function definition.\r\nThe user chooses the size of the house, type of cleaning and possible extras, while the program returns how many employees are needed for cleaning, what the total value is and the description of each cost.\r\n\r\nSistema de servi\u00e7o de limpeza, com estruturas if/elif/else, la\u00e7os de repeti\u00e7\u00e3o e defini\u00e7\u00e3o de fun\u00e7\u00f5es.\r\nO usu\u00e1rio opta pelo tamanho da casa, tipo de limpeza e poss\u00edveis adicionais, enquanto o programa retorna quantos funcion\u00e1rios s\u00e3o necess\u00e1rios para a limpeza, qual o valor total e o descritivo de cada custo.", "created_at": "2022-10-17T15:46:16Z", "repo": "Python", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "91fc8e8f061ef899a60754d9d30ebfa7304e2914", "message": "Update cleaning service\n\nCleaning service system, with if/elif/else structures, repeat loops, and function definition.\r\nThe user chooses the size of the house, type of cleaning and possible extras, while the program returns how many employees are needed for cleaning, what the total value is and the description of each cost.\r\n\r\nSistema de servi\u00e7o de limpeza, com estruturas if/elif/else, la\u00e7os de repeti\u00e7\u00e3o e defini\u00e7\u00e3o de fun\u00e7\u00f5es.\r\nO usu\u00e1rio opta pelo tamanho da casa, tipo de limpeza e poss\u00edveis adicionais, enquanto o programa retorna quantos funcion\u00e1rios s\u00e3o necess\u00e1rios para a limpeza, qual o valor total e o descritivo de cada custo.", "created_at": "2022-10-17T15:45:21Z", "repo": "Python", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "352f6c2a5a2558ffb8e8e1e32e0406dbfb2277b3", "message": "Update ice cream shop\n\nIce cream ordering system, with if/elif/else structures and repeat loops, where user choose ice cream size and flavors, and the program returns each order and the total purchase amount.\r\n\r\nSistema de pedidos de sorvetes, com estruturas if/elif/else e loops de repeti\u00e7\u00e3o, onde o usu\u00e1rio escolhe o tamanho e os sabores do sorvete, e o programa devolve cada pedido e o valor total da compra.", "created_at": "2022-10-17T15:43:08Z", "repo": "Python", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "aa63baf490ffd35335ff882bfa12f9f329047d1a", "message": "Update ice cream shop\n\nIce cream ordering system, with if/elif/else structures and repeat loops, where user choose ice cream size and flavors, and the program returns each order and the total purchase amount.\r\n\r\nSistema de pedidos de sorvetes, com estruturas if/elif/else e loops de repeti\u00e7\u00e3o, onde o usu\u00e1rio escolhe o tamanho e os sabores do sorvete, e o programa devolve cada pedido e o valor total da compra.", "created_at": "2022-10-17T15:42:50Z", "repo": "Python", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f070a622854d4ec54200f09f15eb3f0f9fe2d913", "message": "Update ice cream shop\n\nIce cream ordering system, with if/elif/else structures and repeat loops, where user choose ice cream size and flavors, and the program returns each order and the total purchase amount.\r\n\r\nSistema de pedidos de sorvetes, com estruturas if/elif/else e loops de repeti\u00e7\u00e3o, onde o usu\u00e1rio escolhe o tamanho e os sabores do sorvete, e o programa retorna cada pedido e o valor total da compra.", "created_at": "2022-10-17T15:41:50Z", "repo": "Python", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b96876adef4dc69186cff68c197db3663f5e867c", "message": "Update ice cream shop\n\nIce cream ordering system, with if/elif/else structures and repeat loops, where user choose ice cream size and flavors, and the program returns each order and the total purchase amount.\r\n\r\nSistema de pedidos de sorvete, com estruturas if/elif/else e la\u00e7os de repeti\u00e7\u00e3o, onde o usu\u00e1rio escolhe o tamanho e sabores do sorvete, e o programa retorna cada pedido e o valor total da compra.", "created_at": "2022-10-17T15:40:27Z", "repo": "Python", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ab68122eb27067176b113e449502aed963d46653", "message": "Update basic e-commerce\n\nExercise developed for the subject of Programming Logic and Algorithms, with the objective of creating a \"virtual store\" with if/elif/else structures, where the user would be able to enter the value and quantity of the product, and the program would return the total value and shipping costs, based on the quantity informed.\r\n\r\nExerc\u00edcio desenvolvido para a mat\u00e9ria de L\u00f3gica de Programa\u00e7\u00e3o e Algoritmos, com o objetivo de criar uma \"loja virtual\" com estruturas if/elif/else, onde o usu\u00e1rio conseguiria inserir o valor e a quantidade do produto, e o programa retornaria o valor total e o frete, baseado na quantidade informada.", "created_at": "2022-10-17T15:37:59Z", "repo": "Python", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3ef6be7b461001738f0c44e61da52ceb45954ec4", "message": "Update basic e-commerce\n\nExercise developed for the subject of Programming Logic and Algorithms, with the objective of creating a \"virtual store\" with if/elif/else structures, whe